  "description": {
    "text": "The 2008 Pokémon World Championships, held from 15 to 17 August 2008 at the Hilton Orlando Lake Buena Vista in Florida. Competitors got Tropical Wind in seven languages; top finishers got copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Finalist, and staff a Staff copy.\n\nThe top three of each age division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards.",
